    checklist:["I chose a location and drew a plan","I included water, stables, a market and a rest area","I added a safety feature (a wall, a gate, a lookout)","I wrote three reasons for my location","I named one risk and how to manage it"],
    scaffold:"<b>Services:</b> water · stables · market · rest rooms · storage · gate. <br><b>Reasons:</b> I chose this site because (1) …, (2) …, (3) …. <br><b>Risk:</b> One risk is …, but we could …",
